<title>DENMARK: BADMINTON-DANISH OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-DANISH OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDELFART, Denmark 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Danish</p>
<p>Open badminton quarter-finals on Friday (prefix denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>1-Poul-Erik Hoyer-Larsen (Denmark) beat 9/16-Hermawan Susanto</p>
<p>(Indonesia) 15-2 5-15 15-10</p>
<p>3/4-Thomas Stuer-Lauridsen (Denmark) beat Kenneth Jonassen</p>
<p>(Denmark) 15-7 15-1</p>
<p>3/4-Ong Ewe Hock (Malaysia) beat 9/16-Martin Lundgaard Hansen</p>
<p>(Denmark) 15-12 17-1</p>
<p>Peter Gade (Denmark) beat 9/16 Hendrawan (Indonesia) 15-13</p>
<p>11-15 18-17 </p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>3/4-Christine Gandrup (Sweden) beat 5/8-Lydia Djaelawijaya</p>
<p>(Indonesia) 7-11 11-4 11-0</p>
<p>Gong Zhichao (China) beat Morgan Kelly (Wales) 11-1 11-0</p>
<p>5/8-Mette Pedersen (Denmark) beat 2-Yuliani Santoso (Indonesia)</p>
<p>6-11 11-2 12-11</p>
<p>Marina Andrievskaya (Sweden) beat 3/4-Anne Sondergaard</p>
<p>(Denmark) 11-5 10-12 11-8</p>
</text>
